---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Summary from '../components/Summary.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Why Choose Tangible | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Award-winning therapy at Utah's lowest rates: $115 cash or ~$25 with insurance. Utah's \"Best of State\" therapists in Provo, Orem & Sandy."}>
<section class="sec t-black h-medium has-bg has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/tangible-31-8bf154.jpg" alt="A therapist and client in a calm conversation in a bright office with tall plants at Tangible Therapy in Utah" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.4"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:9;--mrows:9">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/8/21;--m:1/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Why Choose Tangible?</h1><p class="ta-center">Quality care that's actually accessible, because everyone deserves exceptional therapy</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:8/11/10/17;--m:7/3/9/9;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Book Your First Session</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#fff" /></section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:15;--mrows:35">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/5/12;--m:7/2/9/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Recognized as Utah’s best</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:3/13/9/20;--m:1/2/7/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/best-of-state-utah-c72934.webp" alt="An image depicting Tangible Therapy&#x27;s &quot;best of state&quot; award in 2026 for mental health services" width="1914" height="1894" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/15/12;--m:9/2/23/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>We believe the quality of our work is reflected in the trust and feedback of our clients and community.</p><p>Both in 2025 and 2026, we were honored with the Best Counseling Center of Utah Valley award, and in 2026 we brought home Best of State, Utah's most prestigious recognition for businesses that set the standard in their industry.</p><p>Tangible Therapy is the top-rated therapy clinic on Google across the entire state of Utah. </p><p>We're proud of these accolades, but what they really represent is something simpler: hundreds of people who came to us struggling, did the work, and left better. That's what we're here for.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/19/13/25;--m:23/2/29/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/best-counseling-center-4-2fe71e.png" alt="An image depicting Tangible Therapy&#x27;s &quot;Best Counseling Center of Utah Valley&quot; award in 2025 and 2026" width="1890" height="2363" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:9/14/15/19;--m:29/2/35/10;--dz:6;--mz:6"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/thanks-for-your-support-4-5047e1.png" alt="An image depicting Tangible Therapy&#x27;s 5 star google review representing their ranking as the best rated clinic in Utah on Google." width="2160" height="1470" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:15;--mrows:25">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/14/13;--m:17/2/25/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-therapy-male-23b44e.jpg" alt="Female therapist meets with a man doing counseling, sitting on a couch in a warm tone room with plants." width="2439" height="1932" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/6/25;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>We Accept Most Major Insurances</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/15/12/25;--m:5/2/15/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Navigating insurance shouldn't feel like a second job. We've worked hard to accept most major insurance plans so that getting started is as simple as possible. If you're unsure whether we take your insurance or what your cost will be, reach out; we're happy to check for you.</p><p>Our team handles the details so you can focus on what actually matters: showing up and doing the work.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:12/15/14/21;--m:15/2/17/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/insurance-we-accept" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Insurances We Accept</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/13/26;--m:13/2/20/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-counseling-944d69.jpg" alt="Female therapist engaging in Individual counseling with a woman at Tangible Therapy in Utah. Inside a cozy office with warm tones and plants" width="2500" height="1578" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Therapy That Fits Your Budget</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/12/12;--m:4/2/13/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>We believe cost should never be the reason someone doesn't get help. That's why Tangible Therapy offers one of the lowest cash pay rates in the area, just $115 per session. And if you have insurance, your out-of-pocket cost is even less.</p><p>Our average clients with insurance pay only <strong>$25 per session</strong>. Real, high-quality therapy for the price of a dinner out.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:18;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/18/13;--m:19/2/27/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px;--fp:38% 52%"><img src="/images/tangible-29-f6346a.jpg" alt="Female therapist sits across from a client sitting in a comfy chair in a warmly lit therapy office in Provo Utah" width="2499" height="1718" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/6/25;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Clinicians Who Specialize, Not Just Generalize</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/15/19/25;--m:5/2/19/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Every therapist at Tangible Therapy is trained in EMDR, a highly effective, research-backed treatment for trauma, anxiety, and more. But we didn't stop there.</p><p>Our clinicians hold certifications and advanced training across a range of specialized modalities, so you can be matched with a therapist who has genuine expertise in what you're working through.</p><p>Our specializations include:</p><ul><li><p>EMDR</p></li><li><p>Gottman-trained couples Therapists</p></li><li><p>IFS Level 1 trained therapists</p></li><li><p>Autism Affirming Specialists</p></li><li><p>OCD Specialists</p></li></ul></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:19;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/19/26;--m:21/2/28/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-therapy-ladies-be199d.jpg" alt="A female therapist does counseling with a woman at Tangible Therapy in Orem Utah. The woman sits on a couch surrounded by plants." width="2203" height="1702" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Quality Training Makes for Quality Therapy</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/19/12;--m:4/2/20/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>We've developed a training model like no other clinic around.  Our therapists aren't dabbling in techniques they read about once. They're building genuine, verified expertise that they bring to every session.</p><p>The result? When you sit down with a Tangible Therapy clinician, you're working with someone who is prepared, not just credentialed.</p><p>What sets our training apart:</p><ul><li><p>Twice as much training hours as other clinics</p></li><li><p>All trainings are certification-level, meaning trainings are top quality </p></li><li><p>Ongoing training requirements, our therapists never stop growing</p></li><li><p>Highly specialized trainings such as EMDR and IFS.</p></li></ul></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:10;--mrows:11">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/6/4/22;--m:1/2/3/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Let’s get started</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/5/8/23;--m:3/2/9/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p class="lg ta-center">You deserve care from therapists who are not only compassionate but genuinely exceptional at what they do, and who won't cost you a fortune. That's the Tangible Therapy difference.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:8/11/10/17;--m:9/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Book Your First Appointment</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:6.6vmax;padding-bottom:6.6vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>What you’ll get</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:3/2;--tfs:calc((2.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:75%;--gap:20px"><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Expertly led Therapy that doesn’t break the bank.</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A better relationship with yourself, your thoughts, and your emotions</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Clinically precise guidance tailored to you and the problems you’re facing</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New skills guided by expertise and experience that will create meaningful change</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A comfortable and inviting atmosphere that promotes mindful reflection and calm</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="/" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New insights into how your mind works and why it engages in unhelpful patterns</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#565d57" /></section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:3;--mrows:8">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/3/22;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Therapists with Openings</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-summary-v2" style="--d:3/5/4/24;--m:4/2/9/10"><Summary kind="team" design="carousel" category="telehealth/current-openings-1" limit={9} perRow={3} rounded /></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/4/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center"> Frequently asked questions </h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/2/14/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What types of issues do you help with in individual counseling?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We support clients through a wide range of challenges, including anxiety, depression, burnout, trauma, self-esteem issues, grief, OCD life transitions, LGBTQ+ issues and more. If it’s affecting your daily life or emotional well-being, it’s worth bringing to the session.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is counseling right for me if I’m not in crisis?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Absolutely. You don’t have to be falling apart to benefit from therapy. Counseling can help you gain insight, build better habits, and feel more grounded — even if things seem “mostly fine.”</p></div></details><details><summary>How do I get started with a therapist?</summary><div class="rte"><p>You can schedule a free 15-minute consultation to see if one of our therapists is a good match. From there, we’ll set up your first full session and begin creating a plan that fits your goals.</p><p><br/></p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/15/10/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What will my first session be like?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Your first session is about getting to know you. We’ll talk about what’s bringing you in, your personal history, and what you’d like to work on. You won’t need to prepare anything or have all the answers — simply show up as you are.</p></div></details><details><summary>How often do I need to come in?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Most clients start with weekly sessions to build momentum, then adjust as needed. You and your therapist will decide on a pace that feels sustainable and supportive for you.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
